<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-AC MILAN WIN EURO SIX-A-SIDE TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AC MILAN WIN EURO SIX-A-SIDE TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>AC Milan won the &quot;Euro 6ix's six-a-side soccer tournament by beating Ajax Amsterdam 6-2 in the final on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Milan - Roberto Baggio 2, Marc Overmars o.g., Pietro Vierchewood, Edgar Davids, Dejan Savicevic</p>
<p>Ajax - Richard Witschge, Frank de Boer</p>
<p>Attendance: 21,000</p>
</text>
